                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. <strong>Sale items, personalized pieces, and custom orders are final sale</strong> and cannot be returned or exchanged. These items will be clearly marked on the product page before purchase. If you have any questions about a specific item, please reach out to us before ordering.</p>",
