                    "text": "<p>We\u2019d love to hear from you! You can reach us at <a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\">info@noritamy.com</a> or through the <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a> page on our website. Our team typically responds within <strong>24\u201348 hours</strong> during business days.</p>",
