                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>You may cancel your order within <strong>48 hours</strong> of placing it by contacting us at <a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\">info@noritamy.com</a>. After 48 hours, your order may already be in production or shipped, and cancellation may not be possible. In that case, you can return the item once received under our standard return policy.</p>",
