                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our US store is optimized for <strong>domestic US shipping</strong>. For international orders, please visit our main website at <a href=\"https://noritamy.co.il\" target=\"_blank\">noritamy.co.il</a>, where we offer worldwide shipping via DHL Express.</p>",
