            },
            "accordion_row_mL1sZd": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I measure my ring size at home?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_nL1sZe": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>There are two easy methods:</p><ul><li><strong>Use a ring you already own:</strong> Choose a ring that fits the finger you want to measure. Measure the inner diameter in millimeters and match it to our size chart on the <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\">Size Guide</a> page.</li><li><strong>Use a paper strip or string:</strong> Wrap a thin strip of paper or soft string around the base of your finger. Mark where it overlaps, then measure the length in millimeters to find your circumference.</li></ul><p><strong>Tip:</strong> Measure at the end of the day when fingers are at their largest, and avoid measuring when your hands are cold. If you\u2019re between sizes, we recommend sizing up.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_nL1sZe"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_oN3uBf": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do you offer custom or personalized pieces?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_pN3uBg": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes! We work with clients to develop <strong>custom-made pieces</strong> upon request. Whether you have a specific design in mind or want to modify an existing piece, reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\">info@noritamy.com</a> to discuss your vision. Please note that custom and personalized orders are <strong>final sale</strong> and cannot be returned.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
